  "description": "Use PostHog Autoresearch, agent-driven predictive models: ask \"who will do X in the next N days?\", let an agent train a model, then score people daily into a person property and `autoresearch_prediction` events. Use when a user wants to predict churn, activity, return, feature adoption, conversion or any event or action per person; create or validate a model from a template; start training or score now; read model quality (holdout vs realized AUC, lift, calibration, likelihood segments, coverage); steer training with suggestions; act on predictions with cohorts, feature flags, workflows or SQL; or diagnose a model that fails to train, scores everyone the same, or stops scoring. Trigger on \"autoresearch\", \"predictive model\", \"propensity score\", \"churn prediction\", \"likely to convert\", \"who will do X\", \"predicted_p_\", \"autoresearch_prediction\", \"realized AUC\", \"champion model\".",
